        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "b391bfed-e825-5d10-bc26-5d43767d22b1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: James J. Marcello, John DiFronzo, Joseph Lombardo, Joseph Andriacchi, Angelo J. LaPietra\n- Organizations: Chicago Outfit\n- Roles: crime boss, front boss, figurehead, Consigliere\n\nFacts:\n- James J. Marcello was born on December 13, 1943.\n- James J. Marcello was also known as Little Jimmy, Jimmy Light, and Jimmy the Man Marcello.\n- In the 1980s, 1990s, and early 2000s, James J. Marcello was a front boss for the Chicago Outfit.\n- Organized crime observers identified James J. Marcello as a figurehead during that period.\n- During that period, John \"No Nose\" DiFronzo, Joseph \"Joey the Clown\" Lombardo, Joseph \"Joe the Builder\" Andriacchi, and Angelo J. LaPietra were described as running the Chicago Outfit's day-to-day operations.\n- Joseph Lombardo was alleged to be the Consigliere of the Outfit.\n- James J. Marcello is an imprisoned crime boss.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
